dSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/29/BabymarutchiSadSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250813204556","caption":"Сад (Рай)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_sleep.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3f/Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_sleep.png/revision/latest?cb=20250813203935","caption":"Спящий (Рай)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_hide.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3c/Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_hide.png/revision/latest?cb=20250818150453","caption":"Скрытие (Рай)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_death.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fd/Babymarutchi_Paradise_sprite_death.png/revision/latest?cb=20250818150452","caption":"Умирание (Рай)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_Nano_Closeup_animated.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/ac/Babymarutchi_Nano_Closeup_animated.gif/revision/latest?cb=20260415152658","caption":"Крупный план (Pompompurin Tamagotchi)"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/fe/fe389956672b2d1d63c2.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiChocoBoxCharms.png","caption":"Tamagotchi Paradise Шоколадница"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_neutral.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/81/Babymarutchi_neutral.png/revision/latest?cb=20250722204955","caption":"На изображении · Бабимарутчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Babymarutchi_Nano_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8e/Babymarutchi_Nano_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20260413200943","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Бабимарутчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/w